
<div class="page-width" style="padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 70px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px;">
    <div class="sy-pill sy-pill-purple" style="margin-bottom: 12px; background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1); color: #7C3AED;">HELP CENTER</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #0F172A;">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #5A626A;">Everything you need to know about our products, shipping, and guarantee.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
    
    <details class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px; cursor: pointer;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #0F172A; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>How long does shipping take to the US & UK?</span>
        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #7C3AED;">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A626A; line-height: 1.6;">
        Orders are processed within 24-48 hours. Shipping takes 7 to 10 business days via USPS Priority Express Air to the United States, Royal Mail to the UK, and ePacket to Canada and Australia. Full real-time tracking is provided via email.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px; cursor: pointer;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #0F172A; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>What is the 30-Night Sleep Guarantee?</span>
        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #7C3AED;">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A626A; line-height: 1.6;">
        We want you to experience genuine pain relief. Sleep on the Deep-Sleep™ Cervical Pillow in your own bed for 30 nights. If your neck stiffness doesn't vanish, simply email support@sunnyeora.com for an immediate 100% refund.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px; cursor: pointer;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #0F172A; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>What payment methods do you accept?</span>
        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #7C3AED;">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A626A; line-height: 1.6;">
        We accept all major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover), Stripe, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and PayPal. All prices are listed and charged in USD ($).
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px; cursor: pointer;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #0F172A; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>How does the LuminaGlow™ Red Light Wand work?</span>
        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #7C3AED;">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A626A; line-height: 1.6;">
        The wand uses 660nm deep red light therapy to stimulate skin collagen, microcurrent stimulation to tone facial muscles, and 104°F therapeutic warmth to boost serum absorption by 300%. Use 5 minutes daily after applying your favorite facial oil.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px; cursor: pointer;">
      <summary style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; color: #0F172A; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>Can I clean retainers and glasses in CrystalSonic™?</span>
        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #7C3AED;">+</span>
      </summary>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A626A; line-height: 1.6;">
        Yes! 45,000Hz acoustic sound waves create microscopic cavitation bubbles that dislodge trapped grime, makeup, and oil from retainers, Invisalign, eyeglasses, diamond jewelry, and watches in 180 seconds using plain tap water.
      </p>
    </details>

  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sunnyeora FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
